unpushed.md

# Every app preference plist is generated here by `bin/prefs --all`, so the
# whole set can be read and compared. Only the ones named below are versioned:
# keeping one is this single line, and `git clean` removes the rest, which
# --all writes again.
preferences/*.plist
!preferences/com.alienator88.Pearcleaner.plist
!preferences/com.bjango.istatmenus.menubar.7.plist
!preferences/com.knollsoft.Rectangle.plist
!preferences/net.freemacsoft.AppCleaner.plist
